  "limitations": [
    "Geometry does not prove no pressure under finger/screw loads. Glass clearance is based on 1 mm adhesive; physical pressure test still needed.",
    "A four-sided locator limits lateral drift but must not clamp the glass. Existing adhesive holds the display to PCB.",
    "The rectangular surrounding wall is open at the back, not a sealed/tuned chamber. Oval seat and adhesive separate the front outlet from rear leakage; gain is unmeasured.",
    "Restoring the smooth rear sacrifices the 0.9 mm desk gap: a flat table may block the rear grille again.",
    "Slider should be installed with rear flat on the desk; it becomes positively captive only after front closure. The front roof is integral. No clip flex is required.",
